OL,3,GNEWSAMini-gardens for bees on bus stop
OL,4,Aroofs approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to introduce "bee bus stops"
OL,7,Faimed to boost biodiversity in urban
OL,8,Fareas have been approved for
OL,9,FPeterborough.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council said 34 bus
OL,12,Fstops could include Living Roofs,
OL,13,Fmini-gardens planted on top of bus
OL,14,Fshelters that are made up of
OL,15,Fwildflowers and other vegetation.
OL,17,FThe initiative was included in its new
OL,18,Fplan for the city's bus stops, which
OL,19,Fwill also see "comfortable seating"
OL,20,Freplace existing perch seats.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
